We couldn't complete this deposit, so we sent the money back.

The USDC went back to the wallet that paid — the full amount, including our
fee. Nothing was kept.

Refunded:    <%= usdc(@order.price_atomic) %> USDC
<% if @order.refund_transaction_id.present? -%>
Transaction: <%= explorer_url(@order.refund_transaction_id) %>
<% end -%>
<% if @order.refunded_at -%>
Sent back:   <%= l(@order.refunded_at, format: :long) %>
<% end -%>
Was for:     L<%= number_with_delimiter(@order.amount_hnl) %> to <%= @order.beneficiary_name %>
Order:       <%= @order.token %>
<% if @order.notes.present? -%>
Reason:      <%= @order.notes %>
<% end -%>

If the account details were the problem, correct them and call the service
again — the price is recalculated at that moment's rate.
